OL,3,GNEWSARoof of factory partially         
OL,4,Acollapses in major fire                
OL,6,FA factory roof partially collapsed     
OL,7,Fduring a major fire in Antrim, forcing 
OL,8,Ffirefighters who were inside the       
OL,9,Fbuilding to withdraw and fight the     
OL,10,Fblaze from outside.                    
OL,12,FMore than 70 firefighters were deployed
OL,13,Fto the "very intense" blaze at the     
OL,14,FMivan facility on the Greystone Road   
OL,15,Fshortly after 23:00 GMT on Wednesday.  
OL,17,FGroup Commander Paul Morrow from the   
OL,18,FNorthern Ireland Fire and Rescue       
OL,19,FService (NIFRS) praised crews who      
OL,20,F"worked tirelessly through the night"  
OL,21,Fin difficult conditions to bring the   
OL,22,Fsituation under control.               
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
